OL,3,GNEWSASir Patrick Stewart mural given
OL,4,Anieces' approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new mural depicting legendary actor
OL,7,FSir Patrick Stewart in his West
OL,8,FYorkshire hometown has been praised by
OL,9,Fhis nieces.
OL,11,FSir Patrick, known not only for his
OL,12,Ffilm roles but also his performances in
OL,13,Fclassical theatre, died on Thursday
OL,14,Faged 86.
OL,16,FArtist Steve Braun appealed on social
OL,17,Fmedia to find a location for the
OL,18,Fartwork in tribute to the Star Trek and
OL,19,FX-Men star.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
