OL,4,Anieces' approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe monochrome mural, painted on the
OL,7,Fside of craft beer shop Sup Mirfield,
OL,8,Fwas visited by his nieces Julie Kershaw
OL,9,Fand Anne Hirst on Wednesday.
